<title>UK: Premier Farnell says integration goes well.</title>
<headline>Premier Farnell says integration goes well.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic components distributor Premier Farnell said on Monday that it was delighted with integration following the group's acquisition of Premier Industrial Corp of the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;The integration is going superbly... I am very pleased with what people have done on both sides of the Atlantic,&quot; chief executive Howard Poulson said in an interview.</p>
<p>The enlarged group was created in April when Britain's Farnell Electronics completed a $2.8 billion takeover of Premier -- a company twice its size.</p>
